{"id": "119941", "name": "נגזרת של e^((x−xⁿ)^(1/k))", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "arccos", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "pz", "params": ["x"], "body": "if numberp(x) then (if x<0 then concat(\"\\\\left(\",tex1(x),\"\\\\right)\") else tex1(x)) elseif atom(x) then tex1(x) elseif member(op(x),[\"+\",\"-\"]) or (op(x)=\"*\" and numberp(first(x)) and first(x)<0) then concat(\"\\\\left(\",tex1(x),\"\\\\right)\") else tex1(x)"}, {"name": "pz1", "params": ["x"], "body": "if not atom(x) and op(x)=\"+\" then concat(\"\\\\left(\",tex1(x),\"\\\\right)\") else tex1(x)"}, {"name": "texmul", "params": ["e"], "body": "simplode(append([pz1(first(args(e)))], map(pz, rest(args(e)))), \" \\\\cdot \")"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>מצאו את הנגזרת של הפונקציה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle{f(x)=\\Large{{{CT:0}}}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle{f'({{CT:1}})} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> הפונקציה היא הרכבה של שלוש פונקציות: מעריכית, חזקה ופולינום. משתמשים בכלל השרשרת פעמיים.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הפונקציה הפנימית ביותר</b><br>נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(h(x)={{CT:2}}\\)</span>. נגזרתה:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ h'(x)={{CT:3}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — החזקה (כלל השרשרת)</b><br><div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\">כלל השרשרת: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\frac{d}{dx}f(g(x))=f'(g(x))\\,g'(x) \\)</span></div>נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g(x)=h(x)^{{{CT:4}}}={{CT:5}}\\)</span>. לפי כלל השרשרת:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ g'(x)={{CT:4}}\\,h(x)^{{{CT:6}}}\\cdot h'(x)={{CT:7}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — הפונקציה המעריכית (כלל השרשרת)</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x)=e^{g(x)}\\)</span>, ולכן לפי כלל השרשרת:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'(x)=e^{g(x)}\\cdot g'(x)={{CT:8}} \\]</p>ולאחר פישוט:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'(x)={{CT:9}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה נכונה</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה נכונה חלקית</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה שגויה</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "varss:listofvars(ans1);\nan1:ans1;\nfor i:1 while i<=length(varss) do an1:ev(an1,varss[i]=v);\n\nq3:v+v^rdm1;\nq2:q3^rdm2;\nq:exp(q2);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "an1", "tans": "diff(p,v)", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "an1", "tans": "-diff(p,v)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><p>נראה שיש לך טעות סימן שכן התשובה שלך היא בדיוק מינוס התשובה הנכונה</p></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "an1", "tans": "diff(q,v)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><p>נראה שגזרת את הביטוי</p> <p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">{{CT:10}} </p> <p>בצורה שגויה ולכן קיבלת שגיאת סימן</p></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "an1", "tans": "diff(p,v)/diff(pp,v)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><p>יש להשתמש בכלל השרשרת בכדי לגזור את הביטוי</p> <p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">{{CT:11}} </p> <p>לפי המשתנה</p> <p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">{{CT:12}}.</p></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "pp", "ppp", "rdm1", "rdm2", "v"], "nvariants": 10}